Third-party components
----------------------

Milestone M0 contains no third-party code. The language core, the command-line
tool, the tests and the build tooling depend only on the Go standard library.

Development-only tooling is not distributed with Atron and is therefore not
listed as a bundled component:

  * golangci-lint (GPL-3.0) - invoked as a separate executable by `make lint`
    and by CI. It is not linked into, or vendored within, any Atron artifact.
  * govulncheck (BSD-3-Clause) - run by CI as a separate executable.

Any future dependency that is compiled into an Atron binary or redistributed in
a release archive must be added to this file, together with its copyright notice
and license text, before the release is published.


